<font color="white">setelah punya keluarga.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:02.355 --> 00:33:03.272
<font color="white">Indah sekali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:07.610 --> 00:33:10.822
<font color="white">Dokter Park,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">terima kasih banyak untuk hari ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:10.905 --> 00:33:12.365
<font color="white">Tidak apa-apa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:13.574 --> 00:33:14.492
<font color="white">Asal kau tahu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:16.202 --> 00:33:20.081
<font color="white">Sepertinya aku tak akan melupakan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">momen hari ini.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:21.582 --> 00:33:22.709
<font color="white">Itu momen…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:24.377 --> 00:33:26.754
<font color="white">yang paling bikin</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku merasa seperti dokter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:30.383 --> 00:33:32.802
<font color="white"><i>- Bus 320 akan segera tiba.</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Oh.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:33.386 --> 00:33:34.762
<font color="white">Aku pamit, ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:34.846 --> 00:33:36.347
<font color="white">Dah, Dokter Muda.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:36.431 --> 00:33:37.515
<font color="white">Dah, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:37.598 --> 00:33:39.517
<font color="white">- Hati-hati di jalan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Baik.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:33:41.144 --> 00:33:42.770
<font color="white">Dia pergi. Bukan, di sini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:33:42.854 --> 00:33:43.938
<font color="white">Dia di sana.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:05.835 --> 00:34:07.086
<font color="white">Di mana ponselku?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:09.714 --> 00:34:11.549
<font color="white">AYAH</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">IBU</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:34:11.632 --> 00:34:13.468
<font color="white">IBU: MASIH DI RUMAH SAKIT?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:13.551 --> 00:34:15.678
<font color="white"><i>Nak, Ibu tahu kau pasti sibuk.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:15.762 --> 00:34:17.722
<font color="white"><i>Tapi Ibu cemas</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>karena belum bisa menghubungimu.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:17.805 --> 00:34:19.807
<font color="white"><i>Apa kau makan dengan teratur?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:19.891 --> 00:34:21.142
<font color="white"><i>Ibu ingin dengar suaramu.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:25.271 --> 00:34:26.355
<font color="white">AYAH</font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:26.439 --> 00:34:28.900
<font color="white"><i>Ibumu khawatir</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>karena kau tak angkat telepon.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:28.983 --> 00:34:32.278
<font color="white"><i>Ayah suruh dia berhenti meneleponmu</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>karena kuliah kedokteran amat berat.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:32.361 --> 00:34:34.155
<font color="white"><i>Kau tak sakit, 'kan?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:35.448 --> 00:34:36.991
<font color="white"><i>Aku tak sakit.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:37.075 --> 00:34:38.451
<font color="white"><i>Akan kuhubungi Ibu nanti.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:34:54.801 --> 00:34:58.679
<font color="white">PANTI WREDA ONYU</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:11.734 --> 00:35:13.236
<font color="white">Cuma kita untuk ronde kedua!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:13.319 --> 00:35:14.737
<font color="white">Boleh juga.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:18.449 --> 00:35:19.492
<font color="white">Mari kita minum.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:20.493 --> 00:35:22.036
<font color="white">- Bersulang!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Bersulang!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:35:32.296 --> 00:35:33.256
<font color="white">Operasi hari ini</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:34.257 --> 00:35:36.217
<font color="white">mungkin operasi terakhir Pak Direktur.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:37.343 --> 00:35:39.512
<font color="white">Dia kehilangan penglihatan sentralnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:40.388 --> 00:35:42.181
<font color="white">Astaga…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:50.940 --> 00:35:52.817
<font color="white">Sebentar. Kau menangis, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:52.900 --> 00:35:55.653
<font color="white">Tidak. Ini bukan tangisan histeris.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:35:57.780 --> 00:35:58.739
<font color="white">Hanya saja…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:00.950 --> 00:36:03.995
<font color="white">Hal yang kulakukan hari ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">terasa seperti mimpi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:36:05.538 --> 00:36:07.707
<font color="white">Profesiku memang dokter,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:07.790 --> 00:36:10.209
<font color="white">tapi aku belum pernah hidup</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai dokter sejati.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:36:18.009 --> 00:36:18.843
<font color="white"><i>Tapi hari ini,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:19.844 --> 00:36:22.847
<font color="white"><i>aku menyelamatkan orang.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:34.734 --> 00:36:36.819
<font color="white"><i>Aku menyelamatkan nyawa seorang anak.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:39.947 --> 00:36:42.074
<font color="white">Kau menyelamatkan nyawa orang setiap hari.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:42.909 --> 00:36:43.784
<font color="white">Kita semua begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:44.702 --> 00:36:45.578
<font color="white">Benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:47.163 --> 00:36:48.331
<font color="white">Kau benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:48.414 --> 00:36:49.332
<font color="white">Sepertinya…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:50.583 --> 00:36:52.877
<font color="white">sudah lama aku tak memikirkannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:54.629 --> 00:36:56.839
<font color="white">Beban yang ditanggung</font><font color="white"></font>

00:36:57.632 --> 00:37:00.343
<font color="white">saat keselamatan pasien tergantung padaku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:01.219 --> 00:37:04.639
<font color="white">Atau mungkin selama ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku hanya menghindarinya…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:37:06.224 --> 00:37:07.642
<font color="white">karena aku tidak kompeten.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:09.101 --> 00:37:11.979
<font color="white">Ayolah. Kau baru minum seteguk!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:24.283 --> 00:37:25.493
<font color="white"><i>Hari ini…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:26.452 --> 00:37:27.495
<font color="white">aku jadi dokter sejati.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:29.205 --> 00:37:30.414
<font color="white">Ya, kau benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:37.588 --> 00:37:39.882
<font color="white">Apa? Lucu saat melihatku menangis?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:39.966 --> 00:37:41.676
<font color="white">Bukan itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:41.759 --> 00:37:43.511
<font color="white">Cara Pak Direktur teriak,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:44.553 --> 00:37:46.764
<font color="white">"Gu Bon-pyeong!"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:49.809 --> 00:37:52.311
<font color="white">Puas sekali!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:54.313 --> 00:37:55.815
<font color="white">Kau lihat muka Kim Chang-su?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:55.898 --> 00:37:58.192
<font color="white">Aku makin benci lihat bajingan itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:37:59.610 --> 00:38:01.028
<font color="white">Aku lupa masih ada esok hari.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:03.823 --> 00:38:05.283
<font color="white">Sekarang baru terasa, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:05.366 --> 00:38:06.409
<font color="white">Ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:06.492 --> 00:38:08.536
<font color="white">Kurasa Pak Direktur sudah gila.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:09.120 --> 00:38:12.206
<font color="white">- Aku juga hampir gila.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Sama.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:14.750 --> 00:38:16.752
<font color="white">Kita semua sudah gila hari ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:19.088 --> 00:38:20.923
<font color="white">Tapi tetap saja,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:21.007 --> 00:38:23.092
<font color="white">besok adalah hari yang baru.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:24.093 --> 00:38:26.804
<font color="white">Dan setelah hari ini,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">hari-hari seperti kemarin</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:38:26.887 --> 00:38:29.015
<font color="white">tak akan pernah kembali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:31.267 --> 00:38:34.478
<font color="white">Sial, aku masih dalam masalah besar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:35.604 --> 00:38:36.939
<font color="white">Aduh…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:38:44.530 --> 00:38:47.366
<font color="white">AKU SAYANG PAMAN</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:05.259 --> 00:39:06.135
<font color="white">Kau sudah tumbuh.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:07.720 --> 00:39:09.305
<font color="white">Tapi masih kurang dari enam jengkal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:10.514 --> 00:39:11.807
<font color="white">Kenapa kau begitu mungil?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:14.560 --> 00:39:15.728
<font color="white"><i>Keponakanmu tujuh tahun, 'kan?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:15.811 --> 00:39:17.229
<font color="white"><i>Anak itu delapan tahun.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:17.313 --> 00:39:18.981
<font color="white">Kau pasti merasa bersalah saat pulang</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:19.523 --> 00:39:20.816
<font color="white">dan melihat keponakanmu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:20.900 --> 00:39:23.069
<font color="white">Percayalah padaku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:23.152 --> 00:39:24.737
<font color="white"><i>Seong-gyu. Ayo pergi bantu.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:27.615 --> 00:39:28.699
<font color="white">Sialan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:31.410 --> 00:39:32.453
<font color="white">Dia benar.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:43.172 --> 00:39:44.882
<font color="white"><i>Dokter Bae, bagaimana operasinya</i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:39:44.965 --> 00:39:45.800
<font color="white">DR. BAE HEUNG-GON</font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:50.721 --> 00:39:52.473
<font color="white"><i>Dokter Bae, maaf soal kejadian tadi…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:39:55.726 --> 00:39:57.937
<font color="white"><i>Dokter Bae, bagaimana keadaan anak itu…</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:03.025 --> 00:40:04.402
<font color="white"><i>Operasi berjalan lancar.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:04.944 --> 00:40:06.821
<font color="white"><i>Anak itu sudah punya harapan.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:08.155 --> 00:40:09.198
<font color="white"><i>Seong-gyu.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:10.116 --> 00:40:11.450
<font color="white"><i>Jaga dirimu.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:35.057 --> 00:40:36.725
<font color="white">PUSAT MEDIS SEONAM UNIVERSITAS GUSEO</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:36.809 --> 00:40:38.686
<font color="white">Ada yang janggal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:39.854 --> 00:40:41.730
<font color="white">Kenapa sepi sekali?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:42.731 --> 00:40:45.151
<font color="white">Jadi, bukan cuma aku yang merasa begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:45.234 --> 00:40:46.902
<font color="white">Kau tak mengagetkanku lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:46.986 --> 00:40:48.362
<font color="white">Kau pasti datang,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Won-jin, si perusak suasana.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:40:48.446 --> 00:40:49.697
<font color="white">Aneh, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:49.780 --> 00:40:51.824
<font color="white">Tak ada siapa pun di depan rumah sakit.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:52.575 --> 00:40:54.034
<font color="white">Tak ada wartawan,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:54.118 --> 00:40:56.829
<font color="white">tak ada pasien dan dokter.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:57.663 --> 00:40:59.290
<font color="white">Terkadang ada hari-hari begini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:40:59.373 --> 00:41:01.375
<font color="white">Mungkin kemarin hari yang kacau.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:01.459 --> 00:41:03.335
<font color="white">Rasanya hari ini terlalu tenang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:16.974 --> 00:41:17.808
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:18.684 --> 00:41:19.768
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:19.852 --> 00:41:21.520
<font color="white">PENGGANTIAN PERSONEL</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:21.604 --> 00:41:22.605
<font color="white">DIBEBASTUGASKAN</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:22.688 --> 00:41:26.775
<font color="white">BU SEUNG-GWON, DO YUN-SIK, BAE HEUNG-GON,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">JO WON-JIN, KIM SEONG-JIN, PARK TAE-GYEONG</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:30.029 --> 00:41:32.239
<font color="white">PEMUTUSAN KONTRAK</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">BEDAH UMUM, GYE SU-JEONG</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:34.533 --> 00:41:35.534
<font color="white">Sialan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:43.417 --> 00:41:45.961
<font color="white">Jadi, setelah mengabaikan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">permintaan kami berkali-kali,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:46.045 --> 00:41:48.714
{\an8}<font color="white">IRB mendadak memutuskan untuk gelar rapat</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:48.797 --> 00:41:50.633
{\an8}<font color="white">dan meninjau prosedur kemarin?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:41:50.716 --> 00:41:53.844
{\an8}<font color="white">Dan kami semua dibebastugaskan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sampai peninjauan selesai?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:54.845 --> 00:41:58.015
<font color="white">Mau darurat atau tidak, jika prosedur</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang belum disetujui dilakukan,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:41:58.098 --> 00:42:00.768
<font color="white">kau tetap harus menjalani</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">peninjauan</font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i> post hoc</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:00.851 --> 00:42:02.478
<font color="white">Kau tahu itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:03.395 --> 00:42:07.149
<font color="white">Tapi itu tidak serta-merta</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">membuat kami dibebastugaskan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:07.233 --> 00:42:10.027
<font color="white">Ini jelas-jelas sidang disiplin.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:10.110 --> 00:42:11.320
<font color="white">Lalu kenapa…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:12.613 --> 00:42:14.073
<font color="white">Kenapa kau melakukannya kemarin?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:14.740 --> 00:42:16.951
<font color="white">Ada apa denganmu, Pak Direktur?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:17.034 --> 00:42:18.077
<font color="white">Jika dibebastugaskan…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:19.537 --> 00:42:21.997
<font color="white">aku harus meninggalkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ruang direktur ini, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:25.167 --> 00:42:28.337
<font color="white">Rapatnya akan digelar nanti malam.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:28.420 --> 00:42:32.591
<font color="white">Sebaiknya kau bicara dengan ketua</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan anggota Magnolia dulu…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:32.675 --> 00:42:34.093
<font color="white">Aku tahu siapa anggota internalnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:34.176 --> 00:42:36.887
<font color="white">Tapi ada anggota</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">multidisiplin eksternal juga.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:36.971 --> 00:42:37.805
<font color="white">Siapa saja mereka?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:39.765 --> 00:42:41.475
<font color="white">Pakar medis eksternalnya</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:42.142 --> 00:42:44.395
<font color="white">adalah Ketua Kim Chang-su</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dari Ikatan Dokter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:44.478 --> 00:42:47.106
<font color="white">Dan perwakilan pasiennya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">adalah Ketua Park Gwang-cheol.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:48.482 --> 00:42:52.570
<font color="white">Bukankah harus mengecualikan orang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan konflik kepentingan langsung?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:53.612 --> 00:42:55.698
<font color="white">Pakar hukumnya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">adalah Pengacara Won Ju-pil.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:42:56.365 --> 00:42:57.199
<font color="white">Begitu rupanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:42:57.950 --> 00:42:58.993
<font color="white">Kau kenal dia?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:01.620 --> 00:43:02.705
<font color="white">Dia pengacara Magnolia.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:03.455 --> 00:43:04.665
<font color="white">Begitu, ya…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:13.132 --> 00:43:14.425
<font color="white">Mari makan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:20.139 --> 00:43:22.182
<font color="white">Apa aku rakus karena malah makan piza</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:22.683 --> 00:43:23.517
<font color="white">pada saat begini?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:23.601 --> 00:43:24.727
<font color="white">Tidak, dia yang rakus.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:24.810 --> 00:43:26.270
<font color="white">Halo, permisi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:26.353 --> 00:43:29.690
<font color="white">Mana reaksinya?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Hargai dong yang sudah mentraktir kalian.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:33.319 --> 00:43:36.155
<font color="white">"Aroma basilnya langsung terasa</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">di setiap gigitan!"</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:36.238 --> 00:43:38.407
<font color="white">"Piza tak pernah gagal."</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:38.490 --> 00:43:39.950
<font color="white">"Dokter Kim, kau yang terbaik!"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:40.034 --> 00:43:41.744
<font color="white">Begitu caranya, Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:43.412 --> 00:43:44.955
<font color="white">Dokter Kim, kau yang terbaik!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:49.335 --> 00:43:52.713
<font color="white">Kukirim pesan jangan ke ruang operasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena dokternya sudah cukup.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:52.796 --> 00:43:54.632
<font color="white">Kenapa masih ngotot datang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:43:54.715 --> 00:43:57.134
<font color="white">Kau nyaris tak lakukan apa-apa,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kini harus disidang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:43:57.760 --> 00:44:01.096
<font color="white">Kenapa kau selalu menabuh drum sendiri?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:01.180 --> 00:44:02.264
<font color="white">Wah, ini enak sekali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:03.390 --> 00:44:04.808
<font color="white">Tahu dari mana?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:04.892 --> 00:44:07.811
<font color="white">Aku memang main drum di klub </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>samulnori</i></font></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebelum gabung klub teater.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:07.895 --> 00:44:10.898
<font color="white">Hubungi aku</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jika kalian butuh orang untuk tampil.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:10.981 --> 00:44:13.025
<font color="white">Apa maksudmu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku nyaris tak lakukan apa-apa?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:13.817 --> 00:44:15.444
<font color="white">Aku melakukan banyak hal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:16.028 --> 00:44:18.322
<font color="white">Kita sudah mohon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">agar prosedurnya disetujui,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:18.405 --> 00:44:19.907
<font color="white">tapi ditolak karena aksi mogok.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:21.200 --> 00:44:24.536
<font color="white">Tapi semua berkas yang kita kumpulkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sudah diserahkan,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:24.620 --> 00:44:25.663
<font color="white">jadi pasti aman, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:26.372 --> 00:44:27.706
<font color="white">Aku meragukannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:28.457 --> 00:44:29.708
<font color="white">Kau sudah kabari Bu Jang?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:31.043 --> 00:44:33.379
<font color="white">- Ya.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Pasti dia marah besar.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:34.630 --> 00:44:36.215
<font color="white">"Aku dipecat. IRB sedang rapat."</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:38.759 --> 00:44:41.053
<font color="white">"Baiklah. Sampai nanti.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:41.136 --> 00:44:42.513
<font color="white">Kita lihat saja hasilnya."</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:43.931 --> 00:44:45.307
<font color="white">Itu justru lebih menakutkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:47.351 --> 00:44:48.268
<font color="white">Karena sudah dipecat,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:49.603 --> 00:44:51.230
<font color="white">aku boleh pulang, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:51.313 --> 00:44:54.400
<font color="white">Daripada pukul drum,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bisakah kau pukul kepalanya biar sadar?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:55.150 --> 00:44:57.653
<font color="white">Kemarin pertama kalinya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">aku lihat Dokter Gye operasi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:44:57.736 --> 00:44:59.279
<font color="white">Dia hebat sekali</font><font color="white"></font>

00:44:59.363 --> 00:45:01.615
<font color="white">sampai aku tak mengenalinya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan hampir mau perkenalkan diri.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:01.698 --> 00:45:04.034
<font color="white">Sepertinya karismanya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">masih ada di ruang operasi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:04.701 --> 00:45:06.161
<font color="white">Sekarang kita harus bagaimana?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:07.955 --> 00:45:10.457
<font color="white">Kita hanya berusaha menyelamatkan pasien.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:10.541 --> 00:45:13.210
<font color="white">Sebagai dokter dan orang dewasa,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kita harus bertanggung jawab.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:14.169 --> 00:45:16.130
<font color="white">Aku siap menghadapi konsekuensi apa pun.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:16.630 --> 00:45:18.715
<font color="white">Tak masalah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">asalkan Hyeon-a baik-baik saja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:19.675 --> 00:45:22.136
<font color="white">Pasien bisa menuntut,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tergantung pada keputusan IRB.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:23.178 --> 00:45:24.138
<font color="white">Benarkah?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:24.638 --> 00:45:27.141
<font color="white">Menurutmu, ibu Hyeon-a akan menuntut kita?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:27.808 --> 00:45:30.018
<font color="white">Meski Hyeon-a sudah punya harapan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:30.102 --> 00:45:31.854
<font color="white">Dokter Jo, kenapa kau begitu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:31.937 --> 00:45:33.564
<font color="white">Kau tak ada kepercayaan pada pasien.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:34.690 --> 00:45:37.860
<font color="white">Aku berani bertaruh,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">itulah yang buat rumah sakit ini sepi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:38.485 --> 00:45:39.987
<font color="white">Pasien dan dokter tak saling percaya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:44.324 --> 00:45:45.159
<font color="white">Halo?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:45.742 --> 00:45:46.994
<font color="white">Aku di luar, di area rumah sakit.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:48.662 --> 00:45:49.705
<font color="white">Bawa mereka masuk.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:49.788 --> 00:45:52.082
<font color="white">Tidak, terima saja. Aku segera ke sana.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:52.166 --> 00:45:53.292
<font color="white">Sampai nanti.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:45:53.375 --> 00:45:55.210
<font color="white">Kau dibebastugaskan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Tak boleh terima pasien.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:55.294 --> 00:45:58.589
<font color="white">Ada kebakaran besar di gedung</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dekat persimpangan taman.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:45:58.672 --> 00:46:01.425
<font color="white">Tahu petugas pemadam kebakaran</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang selalu datang ke IGD?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:46:01.508 --> 00:46:03.177
<font color="white">- Mereka bawa dia masuk.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dokter Kim!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:46:03.260 --> 00:46:05.429
<font color="white">Kau akan mendapat sanksi yang lebih berat!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:05.512 --> 00:46:07.306
<font color="white">Aku tak peduli. Aku harus pergi!</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:10.851 --> 00:46:12.519
<font color="white">Ada tonkatsu di menu siang hari ini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:13.437 --> 00:46:14.938
<font color="white">Aku tak boleh makan itu lagi, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:15.981 --> 00:46:17.107
<font color="white">Ya ampun…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:20.277 --> 00:46:22.404
<font color="white">Mau pergi makan tonkatsu, ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:23.030 --> 00:46:25.741
<font color="white">Jika aku tak bisa cek kondisi Hyeon-a,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">itu juga tak bagus.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:46:27.034 --> 00:46:28.410
<font color="white">Ikut aku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:28.494 --> 00:46:30.621
<font color="white">Aku dipecat,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tapi kalian cuma dibebastugaskan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:46:31.121 --> 00:46:32.748
<font color="white">Baiklah, tunggu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:46:34.541 --> 00:46:36.001
<font color="white">Kita harus cek kondisi pasien.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:33.141 --> 00:47:36.061
<font color="white">BENGKEL BONGBONG</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:40.065 --> 00:47:41.358
<font color="white">SENIN, 4 MEI</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:49.241 --> 00:47:51.159
<font color="white">RUANG SEMINAR</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:53.787 --> 00:47:55.914
<font color="white">Senang sekali</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">saat makan </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>tteokbokki </i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">kemarin.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:47:55.998 --> 00:47:56.832
<font color="white">Mereka masih berdiskusi?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:57.416 --> 00:47:58.875
<font color="white">Kita baru masuk saat dipanggil?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:47:58.959 --> 00:47:59.835
<font color="white">Aku tak tahu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:01.169 --> 00:48:02.963
<font color="white">- Rapatnya selesai?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Sudah dari tadi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:03.547 --> 00:48:04.840
<font color="white">Mereka cepat menuntaskannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:04.923 --> 00:48:06.758
<font color="white">Lalu untuk apa kita dipanggil?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:08.677 --> 00:48:09.761
<font color="white">Ya ampun…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:11.680 --> 00:48:15.559
<font color="white">Lihatlah. Para pahlawan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang melakukan operasi kemarin.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:16.143 --> 00:48:17.144
<font color="white">Duduklah.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:29.698 --> 00:48:31.825
<font color="white">Kenapa kalian melakukannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:31.908 --> 00:48:34.244
<font color="white">Jika kami tak diberi kesempatan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk menjelaskan,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:34.745 --> 00:48:36.204
<font color="white">untuk apa panggil kami ke sini?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:36.288 --> 00:48:38.665
<font color="white">Kami dengar kalian ada di luar,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:38.749 --> 00:48:42.210
<font color="white">jadi rasanya lebih adil</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">jika kami langsung menyampaikannya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:42.294 --> 00:48:43.962
<font color="white">Masalahnya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:44.630 --> 00:48:47.132
<font color="white">memaksakan operasi yang berisiko tinggi</font><font color="white"></font>

00:48:47.215 --> 00:48:50.886
<font color="white">menciptakan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">terlalu banyak celah kegagalan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:50.969 --> 00:48:55.057
<font color="white">Pihak IRB sudah menyadari</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">risiko dalam operasi itu,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:55.140 --> 00:48:57.517
<font color="white">makanya mereka terus menunda</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">rapat peninjauan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:48:58.101 --> 00:49:01.396
<font color="white">Justru mereka harus menggelar rapat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan membahasnya lebih cepat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:01.480 --> 00:49:04.274
<font color="white">Tapi kalian mengabaikannya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">agar bisa melakukan operasi</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:04.358 --> 00:49:05.942
<font color="white">dan membahayakan pasien.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:06.443 --> 00:49:09.988
<font color="white">Mendatangkan tenaga medis luar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tanpa izin resmi</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:10.072 --> 00:49:11.281
<font color="white">juga pelanggaran berat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:11.365 --> 00:49:13.408
<font color="white">Dia datang atas wewenangku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:13.492 --> 00:49:15.160
<font color="white">Itu juga sudah kami pikirkan.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:15.952 --> 00:49:18.914
<font color="white">Kau hampir tak mengenal orang itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:19.539 --> 00:49:22.959
<font color="white">Ruang operasi adalah tempat sakral.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kenapa sembarang orang bisa masuk?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:23.043 --> 00:49:24.002
<font color="white">Konyol sekali.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:25.295 --> 00:49:29.466
<font color="white">Kami membebastugaskan kalian</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk sementara sambil tunggu hasil rapat,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:29.549 --> 00:49:33.053
<font color="white">berdasarkan dugaan yang wajar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bahwa hal begini bisa terulang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:33.136 --> 00:49:36.181
<font color="white">Lalu kudengar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Dokter Kim malah menerima pasien.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:36.264 --> 00:49:39.518
<font color="white">Haruskah aku diam saja</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">saat ada pasien kritis?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:39.601 --> 00:49:42.437
<font color="white">Rumah sakit kekurangan staf</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena aksi mogok kerja.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:42.521 --> 00:49:45.482
<font color="white">Jika kami disanksi karena bertugas,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">lalu siapa lagi yang bekerja?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:45.565 --> 00:49:46.817
<font color="white">dr. Jo Won-jin.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:49:47.901 --> 00:49:53.281
<font color="white">Kau sudah merencanakan operasinya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sejak awal bersama dr. Gye Su-jeong.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:53.365 --> 00:49:56.576
<font color="white">Kau memang tak berniat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">membatalkan operasi itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:49:57.744 --> 00:49:59.246
<font color="white">Kau juga sama, Dokter Park.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:00.455 --> 00:50:01.665
<font color="white">Benar, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:01.748 --> 00:50:04.751
<font color="white">Aku tak menyesal</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">terlibat dalam operasi itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:06.753 --> 00:50:08.255
<font color="white">Kau tak menyesal?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:08.839 --> 00:50:10.966
<font color="white">Dokter Do dan Dokter Bae.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:11.049 --> 00:50:12.259
<font color="white">Kalian juga tak menyesal?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:13.385 --> 00:50:15.929
<font color="white">Kejadian kemarin adalah situasi darurat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:16.513 --> 00:50:19.933
<font color="white">Tak ada pilihan lain.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Kami terpaksa melakukannya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:20.684 --> 00:50:24.521
<font color="white">Kami akan menerima segala konsekuensinya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:24.604 --> 00:50:27.607
<font color="white">Tapi tolong pertimbangkan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bahwa nyawa seorang anak terancam…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:27.691 --> 00:50:29.776
<font color="white">Direktur Bu Seung-gwon,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dicopot dari jabatan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:30.485 --> 00:50:33.155
<font color="white">dr. Do Yun-sik,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dibebastugaskan selama dua bulan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:33.238 --> 00:50:35.532
<font color="white">dr. Bae Heung-gon,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dibebastugaskan selama sebulan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:35.615 --> 00:50:37.784
<font color="white">dr. Jo Won-jin,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dibebastugaskan selama tiga bulan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:37.868 --> 00:50:40.203
<font color="white">dr. Kim Seong-jin,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dibebastugaskan selama sebulan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:40.287 --> 00:50:42.414
<font color="white">dr. Park Tae-gyeong,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dibebastugaskan selama dua bulan.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:42.497 --> 00:50:44.916
<font color="white">- Dan…</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Dokter Park seorang magang.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:45.000 --> 00:50:47.043
<font color="white">Dua bulan terlalu berat baginya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:47.127 --> 00:50:50.338
<font color="white">Itu tak adil bagi magang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang hanya punya waktu satu tahun</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:50:50.422 --> 00:50:52.257
<font color="white">untuk menyelesaikan rotasi departemen.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:52.340 --> 00:50:53.341
<font color="white">Gye Su-jeong.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:50:57.137 --> 00:50:58.388
<font color="white">Pemutusan kontrak tetap berlaku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:02.017 --> 00:51:04.311
<font color="white">Jika ada kesalahan…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:04.853 --> 00:51:06.980
<font color="white">Jika terjadi sesuatu pada anak itu…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:07.063 --> 00:51:08.148
<font color="white">Hyeon-a.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:10.901 --> 00:51:11.818
<font color="white">Lee Hyeon-a.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:12.986 --> 00:51:14.738
<font color="white">Bagaimanapun hasil akhir si pasien,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:14.821 --> 00:51:18.033
<font color="white">ini tetap bermuara</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">ke etika praktik kedokteran.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:18.116 --> 00:51:21.745
<font color="white">Apakah mempertaruhkan nyawa pasien</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">lewat operasi yang nekat</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:21.828 --> 00:51:25.499
<font color="white">hanya sepenuhnya demi kebaikan si pasien?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:25.582 --> 00:51:27.793
<font color="white">Itulah fokus utama kami.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:29.336 --> 00:51:30.462
<font color="white">Intinya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:31.087 --> 00:51:33.840
<font color="white">kami menyelesaikannya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebelum diselidiki otoritas kesehatan,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:33.924 --> 00:51:35.258
<font color="white">jadi terima saja konsekuensinya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:35.884 --> 00:51:38.845
<font color="white">Masalah kuota fakultas kedokteran</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan aksi mogok sudah berat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:38.929 --> 00:51:41.848
<font color="white">Mari akhiri</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebelum mereka mencari kesalahan kita.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:51:46.937 --> 00:51:48.021
<font color="white">Oh, ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:48.104 --> 00:51:50.023
<font color="white">Bu Seung-gwon… Maksudku, Dokter Bu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:50.106 --> 00:51:51.983
<font color="white">Kenapa tak coba pintu itu di ruanganmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:52.609 --> 00:51:53.610
<font color="white">Ini hari terakhirmu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:51:53.693 --> 00:51:56.404
<font color="white">jadi sebaiknya kau mencobanya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:01.785 --> 00:52:02.619
<font color="white">Ada apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:03.370 --> 00:52:05.247
<font color="white">Apakah rapatnya sudah selesai?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:05.747 --> 00:52:08.291
<font color="white">Sayang sekali. Padahal aku menantikannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:08.834 --> 00:52:10.168
<font color="white">- Dan kau siapa?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Oh, ya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:52:10.252 --> 00:52:13.046
<font color="white">Halo, aku Jang Hui-suk.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:14.714 --> 00:52:16.508
<font color="white">Oh, wanita melon itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:17.634 --> 00:52:21.054
<font color="white">Jika kau butuh melon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan sedang mencari pekerjaan,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:52:21.137 --> 00:52:23.223
<font color="white">simpanlah kartu namaku.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:25.767 --> 00:52:28.770
<font color="white">Oh, ini ibu Nn. Lee Hyeon-a.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:29.271 --> 00:52:31.648
<font color="white">Astaga, halo.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:32.899 --> 00:52:34.568
<font color="white">- Ayo pergi.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Baik, Pak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:52:34.651 --> 00:52:35.527
<font color="white">Maaf.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:36.528 --> 00:52:38.154
<font color="white">Apakah sanksinya telah diputuskan?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:38.238 --> 00:52:39.322
<font color="white">Bu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:39.948 --> 00:52:42.409
<font color="white">Itu pasti berat sekali bagimu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:42.492 --> 00:52:44.160
<font color="white">Sanksi telah diputuskan secara final.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:44.244 --> 00:52:45.954
<font color="white">Cukup perhatikan anakmu sekarang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:46.580 --> 00:52:48.623
<font color="white">Kami sibuk, jadi kami permisi dulu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:48.707 --> 00:52:51.001
<font color="white">Operasi anakku kemarin</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:51.084 --> 00:52:53.169
<font color="white">berbahaya dan tidak patut dicoba.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:53.962 --> 00:52:55.755
<font color="white">Apakah itu alasan kalian memutuskannya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:56.506 --> 00:52:58.550
<font color="white">Ya, pada dasarnya begitu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:52:58.633 --> 00:53:00.260
<font color="white">Kalau begitu, aku mau menuntut.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:10.228 --> 00:53:14.858
<font color="white">Aku mau menuntut dokter bedah utamanya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan semua orang di ruang operasi itu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:19.070 --> 00:53:20.280
<font color="white">Tentu saja.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:20.363 --> 00:53:23.533
<font color="white">Kami tak akan menghalangimu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">mengambil tindakan hukum.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:23.617 --> 00:53:26.870
<font color="white">Pendapat IRB punya kekuatan hukum.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:26.953 --> 00:53:29.080
<font color="white">Kami bisa memberikan materinya kapan pun…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:29.164 --> 00:53:32.959
<font color="white">Aku juga mau menuntut Pusat Medis</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Universitas Guseo dan Yayasan Guseo.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:34.794 --> 00:53:36.421
<font color="white">Awalnya kami di rumah sakit pusat.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:36.922 --> 00:53:39.841
<font color="white">Tapi mereka merujuk kami ke sini,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">katanya tak ada pilihan lagi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:40.634 --> 00:53:43.595
<font color="white">Rasanya kami dicampakkan ke sini.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:44.471 --> 00:53:47.766
<font color="white">Jika rumah sakit pusat</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tak merujuk kami ke sini secara sembrono,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:47.849 --> 00:53:50.060
<font color="white">anakku tak akan menjalani operasi itu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:51.436 --> 00:53:54.522
<font color="white">Bu, mari kita bicarakan nanti…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:54.606 --> 00:53:55.607
<font color="white">Selain itu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:53:55.690 --> 00:53:58.902
<font color="white">aku juga mau menuntut yayasan rumah sakit</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">karena mempekerjakan dokter</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:53:58.985 --> 00:54:00.362
<font color="white">yang lakukan operasi berisiko.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:01.196 --> 00:54:03.239
<font color="white">Aku akan menuntut</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">semua pihak yang terlibat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:03.323 --> 00:54:05.575
<font color="white">Sanksi hari ini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bukti pertanggungjawaban, 'kan?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:10.205 --> 00:54:12.666
<font color="white">Kenapa aku harus menuntut Dokter Gye?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:12.749 --> 00:54:15.835
<font color="white">Hanya dia yang mau menangani Hyeon-a.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:17.003 --> 00:54:18.546
<font color="white">Bukan hanya dia. Semua orang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:19.297 --> 00:54:22.050
<font color="white">Bilang saja kau akan tuntut</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">rumah sakit dan yayasannya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:23.343 --> 00:54:24.386
<font color="white">Aku?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:24.469 --> 00:54:27.639
<font color="white">Supaya Dokter Gye</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bisa tetap bekerja di sini</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:28.431 --> 00:54:30.684
<font color="white">dan memantau kondisi Hyeon-a.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:31.977 --> 00:54:35.438
<font color="white">Bu, aku tahu kau merasa frustrasi,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:36.648 --> 00:54:39.609
<font color="white">tapi tak ada gunanya.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Ibarat melempar batu besar dengan telur.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:39.693 --> 00:54:41.361
<font color="white">Pasien selalu kalah jika menuntut…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:41.444 --> 00:54:43.905
<font color="white">Telur dilempar</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">bukan untuk memecahkan batu besar.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:44.656 --> 00:54:45.532
<font color="white">Apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:46.533 --> 00:54:49.869
<font color="white">Tapi supaya cipratan telurnya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">meninggalkan bekas.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:51.079 --> 00:54:54.082
<font color="white">Lalu cipratannya akan berbau busuk</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan menyengat seiring waktu</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:54:54.791 --> 00:54:56.584
<font color="white">sampai tak pernah hilang.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:57.377 --> 00:54:58.211
<font color="white">Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:54:58.294 --> 00:55:00.046
<font color="white">Tak akan ada yang mau membersihkannya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:00.755 --> 00:55:03.383
<font color="white">Dan makin banyak telur dilempar ke sana.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:03.466 --> 00:55:05.969
<font color="white">Lalu orang-orang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">akan menunjuknya dan bilang…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:55:07.971 --> 00:55:08.930
<font color="white">"Itu tempatnya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:10.765 --> 00:55:12.183
<font color="white">Tempat yang busuk."</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:18.690 --> 00:55:21.484
<font color="white">Mereka menangguhkan sanksinya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:21.568 --> 00:55:22.444
<font color="white">Terima kasih.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:23.611 --> 00:55:25.488
<font color="white">Tapi cuma ditangguhkan, bukan dicabut.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:26.406 --> 00:55:28.742
<font color="white">Mereka cuma tak mau kehilangan muka.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:28.825 --> 00:55:29.868
<font color="white">Jangan khawatir.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:32.912 --> 00:55:33.913
<font color="white">Terima kasih.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:35.832 --> 00:55:36.791
<font color="white">Tak apa-apa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:37.792 --> 00:55:40.086
<font color="white">Kau menyelamatkan anakku, Dok.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:40.962 --> 00:55:42.047
<font color="white">Aku harus balas jasamu.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:44.632 --> 00:55:45.592
<font color="white">Permisi, ya.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:50.805 --> 00:55:51.639
<font color="white">Satu hal lagi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:52.432 --> 00:55:53.767
<font color="white">Dokter Gye.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:54.267 --> 00:55:55.435
<font color="white">Ya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:55.518 --> 00:55:58.188
<font color="white">Bisa ulangi ucapanmu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:55:59.522 --> 00:56:01.858
<font color="white">Aku tahu itu tak akan cukup</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:02.650 --> 00:56:05.779
<font color="white">setelah semua masalah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang dialami Hyeon-a…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:06.529 --> 00:56:07.655
<font color="white">Tapi tetap saja…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:07.739 --> 00:56:10.325
<font color="white">Aku tak akan pernah…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:12.410 --> 00:56:13.578
<font color="white">gagal.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:19.793 --> 00:56:20.668
<font color="white">Terima kasih.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:28.134 --> 00:56:29.302
<font color="white">LEE HYEON-A, PEREMPUAN/8</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:30.386 --> 00:56:34.349
<font color="white">DOKTER UTAMA: GYE SU-JEONG</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:34.432 --> 00:56:35.600
<font color="white">KONSTRUKSI DINDING GEDUNG UTAMA</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:35.683 --> 00:56:37.310
<font color="white">Aku cuma dibebastugaskan sehari,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:37.393 --> 00:56:39.979
<font color="white">tapi aku jadi makin menghargai</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pekerjaanku.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:40.063 --> 00:56:43.274
<font color="white">- Itu yang kurasakan.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- Tapi kau masih menerima pasien.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:43.358 --> 00:56:45.902
<font color="white">Petugas pemadam itu</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan sebagian besar rekannya selamat.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:45.985 --> 00:56:47.362
<font color="white">Tapi ada satu yang mati otak.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:48.488 --> 00:56:50.240
<font color="white">Dia mau mendonorkan organnya,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:50.323 --> 00:56:51.574
<font color="white">dan keluarganya sudah tahu,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:56:52.158 --> 00:56:55.537
<font color="white">jadi koordinator transplantasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sudah mulai menghubungi berbagai pihak.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:56:58.665 --> 00:57:00.834
<font color="white">Daripada memajang hal-hal begini,</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:00.917 --> 00:57:04.003
<font color="white">lebih baik dananya dipakai</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk menyelesaikan konstruksi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:07.257 --> 00:57:08.258
<font color="white">Kalian tetap di sini?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:09.467 --> 00:57:10.677
<font color="white">Kalau begitu, sampai jumpa.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:23.440 --> 00:57:24.649
<font color="white">"Gu Yeo-rim.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:24.732 --> 00:57:28.194
<font color="white">Direktur pertama Pusat Medis Guseo.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:28.278 --> 00:57:29.654
<font color="white">Pen-da…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:30.238 --> 00:57:31.573
<font color="white">Pen-da…"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:31.656 --> 00:57:33.032
<font color="white">"Pendahulu</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:33.116 --> 00:57:34.701
<font color="white">Pusat Medis Universitas Guseo".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:34.784 --> 00:57:37.829
<font color="white">- "Pe-rin…"</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">- "Perintis".</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:37.912 --> 00:57:40.457
<font color="white">"Perintis bagi kaum wanita di bidang…"</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:40.540 --> 00:57:41.416
<font color="white">"Kedokteran.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:41.499 --> 00:57:43.251
<font color="white">Beliau memimpin perluasan</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:43.918 --> 00:57:45.420
<font color="white">layanan ginekologi".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:45.503 --> 00:57:47.422
<font color="white">Teruslah membaca.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:48.548 --> 00:57:50.550
<font color="white">Aku belajar cara mengucapkannya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dalam bahasa Korea.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:51.176 --> 00:57:52.802
<font color="white"><i>Chukhahamnida.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:57:52.886 --> 00:57:55.889
<font color="white">Suatu kehormatan bisa bekerja sama</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan dokter bedah sepertimu.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:57:56.890 --> 00:57:59.184
<font color="white">Kau akan pulang</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk menerima jantung baru.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:58:00.059 --> 00:58:02.061
<font color="white">Selamat, ya. Dengan setulus hati.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:12.739 --> 00:58:13.740
<font color="white"><i>- Benarkah?</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>- Ya.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:13.823 --> 00:58:15.450
<font color="white">Sebentar, itu berarti…</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:15.533 --> 00:58:17.577
<font color="white">Dia ke sini</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">untuk mendapatkan transplantasi.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:58:19.829 --> 00:58:21.664
<font color="white">Kita bisa langsung melihatnya?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:21.748 --> 00:58:24.167
<font color="white">Tapi dari sekian banyak tempat,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">kenapa di sini?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:58:24.250 --> 00:58:25.793
<font color="white">Kenapa bukan di tempat lain?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:25.877 --> 00:58:29.088
<font color="white">Apa maksudmu? Memangnya ada masalah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan rumah sakit kita?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:58:39.265 --> 00:58:40.099
<font color="white">Ada apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:40.183 --> 00:58:41.309
<font color="white">Ada masalah apa?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:58:42.018 --> 00:58:44.521
<font color="white">Ada apa? Apa Su-jeong mengalami sesuatu?</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:10.547 --> 00:59:12.090
<font color="white"><i>Siapa pria itu?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:13.132 --> 00:59:14.217
{\an8}<font color="white">"Kim Seung-hyo.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:14.300 --> 00:59:17.679
<font color="white">Lulusan Universitas Guseo</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan dokter bedah yang mendirikan</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:17.762 --> 00:59:21.933
<font color="white">organisasi relawan medis,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Korps Medis White Wings.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:22.016 --> 00:59:27.522
<font color="white">Beliau memberikan layanan kemanusiaan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dan bantuan medis di negara-negara miskin,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:27.605 --> 00:59:29.524
<font color="white">sehingga dinominasikan dapat Hadiah Nobel.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:30.024 --> 00:59:32.986
<font color="white">Menyelamatkan banyak anak</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">dengan kemampuannya yang luar biasa,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:33.069 --> 00:59:35.196
<font color="white">beliau dihormati di eranya</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">sebagai dokter sejati</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:35.280 --> 00:59:37.991
<font color="white">berhati emas dan bertangan Tuhan".</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:39.701 --> 00:59:40.702
<font color="white">Ayo kita pergi.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:41.619 --> 00:59:43.621
<font color="white">Kau pintar membaca, Ga-eul.</font><font color="white"></font>

00:59:46.916 --> 00:59:50.295
{\an8}<font color="white">KIM SEUNG-HYO</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">PENDIRI KORPS MEDIS WHITE WINGS</font><font color="white"></font></font>

00:59:57.093 --> 01:00:01.097
<font color="white">Kenapa dia ngotot ingin dioperasi</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">di rumah sakit ini?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:01.180 --> 01:00:02.932
<font color="white">Bukankah mobilitasnya terbatas?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:03.016 --> 01:00:05.977
<font color="white">Katanya wali dan dokter bedah</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">yang diinginkannya</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:06.060 --> 01:00:07.729
<font color="white">ada di rumah sakit kita.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:07.812 --> 01:00:09.480
<font color="white">Siapa walinya?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:09.981 --> 01:00:14.861
<font color="white">TOKOH KEBANGGAAN GUSEO</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:38.593 --> 01:00:40.595
<font color="white"><i>Walinya adalah dr. Jo Won-jin.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:42.347 --> 01:00:44.682
<font color="white">dr. Jo Won-jin?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:44.766 --> 01:00:46.643
<font color="white">Lalu siapa dokter bedahnya?</font><font color="white"></font>

01:00:47.518 --> 01:00:50.772
<font color="white">Dokter yang melakukan</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">transplantasi pertamanya.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:00:57.320 --> 01:00:58.613
<font color="white"><i>dr. Gye Su-jeong.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:02.867 --> 01:01:03.785
<font color="white">Tante.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:04.911 --> 01:01:07.914
<font color="white">Tante, bangunlah!</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:08.998 --> 01:01:09.916
<font color="white">Tante!</font><font color="white"></font>

01:01:58.297 --> 01:02:00.299
<font color="white">DUA HARI KEMUDIAN</font><font color="white"></font>

01:02:00.925 --> 01:02:04.595
<font color="white">PASIEN: KIM SEUNG-HYO</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">DOKTER BEDAH UTAMA: GYE SU-JEONG</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:02:22.321 --> 01:02:24.741
<font color="white">PASIEN: KIM SEUNG-HYO</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">DOKTER BEDAH UTAMA: GYE SU-JEONG</font><font color="white"></font></font>

01:02:59.192 --> 01:03:00.067
<font color="white">Park Tae-gyeong.</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:02.195 --> 01:03:03.070
<font color="white">Park Tae-gyeong!</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:27.887 --> 01:03:29.847
<font color="white">Sudah lama tak bertemu…</font><font color="white"></font>

01:03:33.392 --> 01:03:35.520
